@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

### Billing plan options
# Expected: 200 OK with configured plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout/options

### Save checkout review without payment provider handoff
# Expected: 200 OK with saved review status when Stripe price is not connected or review-only flow is used
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": "starter"
}

### Start checkout
# Expected: 200 OK with review or checkout payload, or 400 when plan is invalid
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": "starter"
}

### Open billing portal
# Expected: 200 OK with portal URL for signed-in customers, 401 when session is missing, 404 when billing is not linked
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/portal
Cookie: authjs.session-token=<paste-local-session-cookie>
